From c1417b2b1142af4ca580864edd782fa5e04b14bc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: probonopd <probonopd@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 26 Jul 2026 19:49:38 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] AVFoundation: AVCapture recording classes via libavdevice
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- AVCaptureSession — capture lifecycle via FFmpeg avdevice (ALSA/OSS/Pulse)
- AVCaptureDevice — audio device representation
- AVCaptureDeviceInput — connect device to session
- AVCaptureAudioDataOutput — delegate callback with float PCM samples
- GNUmakefile.preamble: add libavdevice, libswresample with pkg-config fallback
- Replaces empty stubs with working implementations
